@startuml workflow-states
title Logical ticket states (native names come from [workflow.statuses])
[*] --> ready : readiness gate passes\n+ ready label
ready --> in_progress : claim (assignee + lease)
in_progress --> ready : lease expired -> reclaimable
in_progress --> spec_review : hard ticket, spec posted
spec_review --> in_progress : spec approved\n(spec_approved label)
in_progress --> needs_info : numbered questions
spec_review --> needs_info
needs_info --> in_progress : allowed human reply
needs_info --> stalled : stall_timeout_hours
in_progress --> blocked : restricted file / submodule failure
in_progress --> failed : max_attempts or spend cap
in_progress --> in_review : MR opened / branch pushed
in_review --> in_review : MR comment loop
in_review --> done : human merges
done --> [*]
note right of in_review
  The factory never sets done itself;
  humans or CI close the ticket on merge.
end note
@enduml
